WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.095 --> 00:00:11.818
"Cock-a-doodle-doo."

2
00:00:11.819 --> 00:00:21.416
"Cluck, cluck, peep, peep."

3
00:00:21.417 --> 00:00:28.605
I feed the chickens.

4
00:00:28.606 --> 00:00:36.756
"Baa, baa."

5
00:00:36.757 --> 00:00:43.562
I feed the sheep.

6
00:00:43.563 --> 00:00:51.885
"Quack, quack."

7
00:00:51.886 --> 00:00:59.564
I feed the ducks.

8
00:00:59.565 --> 00:01:08.047
"Neigh, neigh."

9
00:01:08.048 --> 00:01:15.582
I feed the horse.

10
00:01:15.583 --> 00:01:24.590
"Moo, moo."

11
00:01:24.591 --> 00:01:32.739
I feed the cow.

12
00:01:32.740 --> 00:01:41.322
"Oink, oink."

13
00:01:41.323 --> 00:01:48.785
I feed the pig.

14
00:01:48.786 --> 00:01:55.250
"Bark, bark, bark."

15
00:01:55.251 --> 00:01:58.617
Oh! You are hungry too!

16
00:01:58.618 --> 00:02:06.004
I will feed you.

